+# GhostWeb Signal — Liquid Glass Design System
+**Version 2.0 · Photon Edition**
+
+---
+
+## 1. Brand Overview
+
+**GhostWeb Signal** is a privacy-first messaging app built on the Signal protocol.  
+The new **Liquid Glass Photon** visual language combines:
+
+- Deep navy / ice-blue dark theme (Photon)
+- Soft, translucent **Liquid Glass** surfaces
+- Clean Signal-inspired information architecture
+- Modern tech aesthetic with high legibility
+
+**Tagline:** Secure. Private. Untraceable.
+
+---
+
+## 2. Color System
+
+### 2.1 Core Palette — Dark Mode (Default)
+
+| Token                        | Hex / Value          | Usage                              |
+|-----------------------------|----------------------|------------------------------------|
+| `bg`                        | `#050914`            | App background                     |
+| `surface / panel`           | `#0D1A33`            | Cards, headers, bottom sheets      |
+| `surface_high`              | `#132445`            | Elevated surfaces                  |
+| `surface_low`               | `#08101F`            | Recessed areas                     |
+| `primary / cyan`            | `#5B9DFF`            | Primary actions, unread, accents   |
+| `primary_dim`               | `#7EB6FF`            | Hover / secondary accent           |
+| `teal`                      | `#9CC4FF`            | Soft highlights                    |
+| `text`                      | `#E8EEF8`            | Primary text                       |
+| `text_muted`                | `#8AA0C0`            | Secondary text                     |
+| `success / online`          | `#6EE7B7`            | Online status, success             |
+| `outline`                   | `#57B4D2FF` (35%)    | Glass borders                      |
+| `outline_subtle`            | `#29A0C4FF` (16%)    | Subtle dividers                    |
+| `on_cyan`                   | `#041018`            | Text on primary buttons            |
+
+### 2.2 Core Palette — Light Mode
+
+| Token                        | Hex / Value          | Usage                              |
+|-----------------------------|----------------------|------------------------------------|
+| `bg_light`                  | `#F0F5FF`            | App background                     |
+| `panel_light`               | `#FFFFFF`            | Cards, headers                     |
+| `surface_highest_light`     | `#E8F0FF` / `#D6E6FF`| Elevated / selected                |
+| `primary_light`             | `#2B7BFF`            | Primary actions                    |
+| `text_light`                | `#0A1628`            | Primary text                       |
+| `text_muted_light`          | `#5A6F8C`            | Secondary text                     |
+| `outline_light`             | `#665B9DFF`          | Glass borders                      |
+
+### 2.3 Glass Alpha Tokens
+
+| Token                     | Value              | Usage                        |
+|--------------------------|--------------------|------------------------------|
+| `glass_10`               | 10% cyan           | Very subtle overlays         |
+| `glass_20`               | 20% cyan           | Chips, light glass           |
+| `glass_30`               | 30% cyan           | Status badges                |
+| `glass_surface`          | ~80% panel         | Main glass panels            |
+| `glass_surface_elevated` | ~90% elevated      | Floating elements            |
+
+---
+
+## 3. Typography
+
+- **Primary font:** System / Inter / SF Pro (platform default)
+- **Display / Logo:** Clean geometric sans
+- **Weights:** Regular (400), Medium (500), Semibold (600)
+- **Sizes (mobile):**
+  - Display: 28–34 sp
+  - Title: 20–22 sp
+  - Body: 15–16 sp
+  - Caption: 12–13 sp
+  - Overline: 11 sp
+
+---
+
+## 4. Spacing & Radius
+
+| Token          | Value     |
+|----------------|-----------|
+| `radius.sm`    | 8–10 dp   |
+| `radius.md`    | 14–16 dp  |
+| `radius.lg`    | 20–24 dp  |
+| `radius.full`  | 999 dp    |
+| Spacing scale  | 4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 20 / 24 / 32 dp |
+
+---
+
+## 5. Components
+
+### 5.1 Glass Card / Surface
+- Background: `glass_surface` or `panel`
+- Border: 1 dp `outline_subtle`
+- Corner radius: 16 dp
+- Optional subtle inner glow / elevation
+
+### 5.2 Primary Button
+- Background: `primary` (`#5B9DFF`)
+- Text: `on_cyan`
+- Radius: 14–16 dp
+- Height: 48–52 dp
+
+### 5.3 Message Bubbles
+- **Outgoing:** Soft cyan-tinted glass + primary text
+- **Incoming:** Dark glass panel + light text
+- Radius: 16–18 dp (with tail)
+
+### 5.4 Bottom Navigation
+- Floating glass bar
+- Active item: cyan icon + label
+- Inactive: muted
+
+### 5.5 Avatars
+- Circular
+- Online: thin cyan ring + green status dot
+
+### 5.6 Unread Badge
+- Background: `#5B9DFF`
+- Text: white
+- Pill shape
+
+---
+
+## 6. Elevation & Effects
+
+- Prefer **glass + border** over heavy shadows
+- Soft blur on headers and bottom sheets when supported
+- Subtle cyan glow on focused / active elements
+- No harsh drop shadows
+
+---
+
+## 7. Iconography
+
+- **App icon:** Updated Ghost with liquid glass ring and soft cyan glow
+- System icons: outlined style, 1.5–2 px stroke
+- Accent icons use primary cyan
+
+---
+
+## 8. Accessibility
+
+- Minimum contrast ratio 4.5:1 for body text
+- Interactive targets ≥ 48 × 48 dp
+- Support for system font scaling
+- High-contrast mode should increase border opacity
+
+---
+
+## 9. Implementation Notes (Android)
+
+- Tokens live in `res/values/colors.xml` and `core/ui/.../molly_colors.xml`
+- Primary and surface colors overridden to Photon cyan/navy
+- Custom drawables: `ghostweb_signal_*_background.xml` use glass alpha
+- Material 3 `ColorScheme` consumes the updated molly tokens
+- Splash screen uses `ghostweb_signal_bg`
+
+---
+
+**GhostWeb Enterprise · Liquid Glass Photon Design System v2.0**
